
---
import BaseLayout from '../../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Low-Impact Exercise | Silken Valley Lifestyle"
  description="Explore low-impact exercise, walking, cycling, swimming, chair workouts, stretching, and gentle movement for an active lifestyle."
  heroTitle="Low-Impact Exercise"
  heroText="Enjoy gentle movement, build confidence, and make regular activity part of everyday life."
  heroCompact={true}
>
  <section class="hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">Fitness & Active Living</p>
    <h1>Low-Impact Exercise & Gentle Movement</h1>
    <p>
      Low-impact exercise offers an approachable way to stay
      active while keeping movements controlled and avoiding
      the repeated jumping and running found in many
      high-impact workouts. Whether you enjoy walking,
      cycling, swimming, or gentle stretching, there are
      many ways to incorporate movement into your routine.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="low-impact-intro">
    <h2>The Benefits of Low-Impact Exercise</h2>
    <p>
      Low-impact activities can help develop cardiovascular
      endurance, strength, balance, flexibility, and
      coordination. They can also be adapted to different
      fitness levels and preferences. The goal is to find
      enjoyable activities that encourage consistency and
      support an active lifestyle.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="low-impact-grid">
    <article class="low-impact-card">
      <span class="low-impact-number">01</span>
      <h2>Walking for Fitness</h2>
      <p>
        Walking is one of the simplest ways to add regular
        movement to your day. It can be enjoyed outdoors,
        on a treadmill, or around your home.
      </p>
      <h3>Walking Ideas</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Begin with comfortable, manageable walks.</li>
        <li>Explore local parks and walking trails.</li>
        <li>Try a slightly brisker pace when comfortable.</li>
        <li>Include short walks throughout your day.</li>
        <li>Gradually increase your distance or duration.</li>
      </ul>
    </article>

    <article class="low-impact-card">
      <span class="low-impact-number">02</span>
      <h2>Cycling</h2>
      <p>
        Cycling provides a low-impact cardiovascular
        activity that can be enjoyed outdoors or on
        a stationary bicycle at home.
      </p>
      <h3>Cycling Ideas</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Try a stationary bike at a comfortable pace.</li>
        <li>Explore level outdoor cycling routes.</li>
        <li>Begin with shorter sessions.</li>
        <li>Adjust resistance gradually.</li>
        <li>Maintain a comfortable riding position.</li>
      </ul>
    </article>

    <article class="low-impact-card">
      <span class="low-impact-number">03</span>
      <h2>Swimming & Water Exercise</h2>
      <p>
        Water supports much of the body's weight, making
        swimming and water-based activities appealing
        options for gentle movement.
      </p>
      <h3>Activities to Explore</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Recreational swimming.</li>
        <li>Water walking.</li>
        <li>Gentle water aerobics.</li>
        <li>Pool-based leg movements.</li>
        <li>Easy swimming intervals.</li>
      </ul>
    </article>

    <article class="low-impact-card">
      <span class="low-impact-number">04</span>
      <h2>Chair Exercises</h2>
      <p>
        Seated exercises offer a way to practise movement
        and strength using a stable chair. They can be
        adapted to individual abilities and comfort.
      </p>
      <h3>Exercises to Explore</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Seated marching.</li>
        <li>Seated knee extensions.</li>
        <li>Gentle arm raises.</li>
        <li>Seated heel and toe raises.</li>
        <li>Chair-based upper-body stretches.</li>
      </ul>
    </article>

    <article class="low-impact-card">
      <span class="low-impact-number">05</span>
      <h2>Balance & Stability</h2>
      <p>
        Balance exercises can complement a regular fitness
        routine by encouraging coordination, posture,
        and controlled movement.
      </p>
      <h3>Exercises to Explore</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Supported standing leg raises.</li>
        <li>Heel-to-toe standing.</li>
        <li>Standing weight shifts.</li>
        <li>Supported heel raises.</li>
        <li>Gentle marching in place.</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="low-impact-tip">
        Use a sturdy chair or counter for support when
        practising standing balance exercises.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="low-impact-card">
      <span class="low-impact-number">06</span>
      <h2>Stretching & Gentle Mobility</h2>
      <p>
        Gentle stretching and mobility work can be a
        valuable addition to an active lifestyle,
        helping you practise comfortable movement.
      </p>
      <h3>Movements to Explore</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Gentle neck and shoulder movements.</li>
        <li>Seated spinal rotations.</li>
        <li>Calf and hamstring stretches.</li>
        <li>Gentle hip mobility exercises.</li>
        <li>Relaxed breathing and stretching sessions.</li>
      </ul>
    </article>
  </section>


<section class="low-impact-equipment">
  <p class="eyebrow">Recommended Equipment</p>
  <h2>Comfortable Footwear for Everyday Movement</h2>
  <p>
    Choosing comfortable footwear can make walking and
    everyday movement more enjoyable. Explore these
    New Balance athletic shoes as an option for your
    low-impact exercise routine.
  </p>

  <div class="low-impact-product">
    <h3>New Balance Women's Running Shoes</h3>

    <p>
      Enjoy comfortable footwear for walking, low-impact
      exercise, and everyday movement. These New Balance
      athletic shoes are a versatile addition to an active
      wardrobe, whether you're enjoying a gentle walk or
      keeping up with your daily fitness routine.
    </p>

    <a
      class="low-impact-product-button"
      href="https://www.amazon.ca/New-Balance-Womens-Running-Metallic/dp/B0D1LKD7R1?content-id=amzn1.sym.6c47a4d3-a3b0-4e8c-aa2c-a26906ad2160%3Aamzn1.sym.6c47a4d3-a3b0-4e8c-aa2c-a26906ad2160&cv_ct_cx=runners%2Bfor%2Bwomen&keywords=runners%2Bfor%2Bwomen&pd_rd_i=B0DJVBY3NV&pd_rd_r=1c41757d-44fb-48a0-adc5-b7ef4ae23ea0&pd_rd_w=hem16&pd_rd_wg=AImmk&pf_rd_p=6c47a4d3-a3b0-4e8c-aa2c-a26906ad2160&pf_rd_r=N3TEDSTRP6HYZV5MEANG&qid=1795632433&sbo=RZvfv%2F%2FHxDF%2BO5021pAnSA%3D%3D&sr=1-2-dd2b3927-63c0-4993-8bb8-50aaefac2996-spons&sp_csd=d2lkZ2V0TmFtZT1zcF9zZWFyY2hfdGhlbWF0aWM&th=1&gaOptInStatus=true&psc=1&linkCode=ll2&tag=silkenvalleyl-20&linkId=8373895496df03986ad7ee1f4beb6fcd&gaOptInStatus=true&ref_=as_li_ss_tl"
      target="_blank"
      rel="sponsored nofollow noopener"
    >
      Shop Running Shoes
    </a>
  </div>
</section>


  <section class="low-impact-routine">
    <p class="eyebrow">Consistency</p>
    <h2>A Sample Weekly Low-Impact Routine</h2>
    <p>
      This sample schedule combines gentle cardio,
      strength, balance, and flexibility. Adjust the
      activities and duration to your comfort and
      experience, and include recovery days.
    </p>

    <div class="low-impact-table">
      <div class="low-impact-row">
        <strong>Monday</strong>
        <span>Comfortable outdoor walk</span>
      </div>
      <div class="low-impact-row">
        <strong>Tuesday</strong>
        <span>Gentle strength and chair exercises</span>
      </div>
      <div class="low-impact-row">
        <strong>Wednesday</strong>
        <span>Stationary cycling or water exercise</span>
      </div>
      <div class="low-impact-row">
        <strong>Thursday</strong>
        <span>Stretching and mobility</span>
      </div>
      <div class="low-impact-row">
        <strong>Friday</strong>
        <span>Walking and balance exercises</span>
      </div>
      <div class="low-impact-row">
        <strong>Saturday</strong>
        <span>Swimming or enjoyable outdoor activity</span>
      </div>
      <div class="low-impact-row">
        <strong>Sunday</strong>
        <span>Rest and recovery</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="low-impact-note">
    <h2>Movement at Your Own Pace</h2>
    <p>
      Low-impact does not mean that exercise has to be
      effortless. Begin at a comfortable level, focus on
      controlled movements, and gradually increase your
      activity as your confidence and fitness develop.
      Choose supportive footwear when appropriate, stay
      hydrated, and allow time for recovery. Stop if you
      experience pain, dizziness, or unusual discomfort.
      If you have health concerns or mobility limitations,
      seek guidance from a qualified health professional
      before beginning a new exercise programme.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="low-impact-links">
    <h2>Explore Workouts</h2>
    <div class="low-impact-link-grid">
      <a href="/fitness/workouts/cardio/">Cardio Workouts →</a>
      <a href="/fitness/workouts/strength-training/">Strength Training →</a>
      <a href="/fitness/workouts/home/">Home Workouts →</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <p class="low-impact-back">
    <a href="/fitness/workouts/">← Return to Workouts</a>
  </p>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .low-impact-intro {
    margin: 30px 0;
    padding: 28px;
    background: var(--rose-wash);
    border-radius: 18px;
  }

  .low-impact-intro h2,
  .low-impact-routine h2,
  .low-impact-note h2,
  .low-impact-links h2 {
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 1.7rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    margin: 0 0 14px;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .low-impact-intro p,
  .low-impact-routine > p:not(.eyebrow),
  .low-impact-note p {
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .low-impact-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 24px;
    margin: 35px 0;
  }

  .low-impact-card {
    padding: 28px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: var(--surface);
    border-radius: 18px;
  }

  .low-impact-number {
    display: inline-block;
    color: var(--accent-dark);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .low-impact-card h2 {
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 1.55rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--text);
    margin: 0 0 13px;
  }

  .low-impact-card h3 {
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--accent-dark);
    margin: 22px 0 10px;
  }

  .low-impact-card p,
  .low-impact-card li {
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .low-impact-card p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .low-impact-card ul {
    padding-left: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .low-impact-card .low-impact-tip {
    margin-top: 16px;
    padding: 12px 14px;
    background: var(--rose-wash);
    border-radius: 10px;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
  }

  .low-impact-routine {
    margin: 40px 0;
  }

  .low-impact-routine .eyebrow {
    color: var(--accent-dark);
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .low-impact-table {
    margin-top: 22px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 16px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .low-impact-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 130px 1fr;
    gap: 15px;
    padding: 16px 20px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: var(--surface);
  }

  .low-impact-row:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .low-impact-row strong {
    color: var(--accent-dark);
  }

  .low-impact-row span {
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .low-impact-note {
    padding: 30px;
    margin: 40px 0;
    background: var(--rose-wash);
    border-radius: 18px;
  }

  .low-impact-links {
    margin: 40px 0;
  }

  .low-impact-link-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 15px;
    margin-top: 20px;
  }

  .low-impact-link-grid a {
    display: block;
    padding: 18px;
    text-align: center;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 14px;
    color: var(--accent-dark);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
    transition: background 0.2s ease;
  }

  .low-impact-link-grid a:hover {
    background: var(--rose-wash);
  }

  .low-impact-back {
    margin-top: 30px;
  }

  .low-impact-back a {
    color: var(--accent-dark);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .low-impact-back a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .low-impact-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .low-impact-link-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .low-impact-row {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 5px;
    }
  }
</style>

